# Screen layout

Follow `doc/screen-layout-system.md`.

## Must

- Wrap every **screen** (module root) in `ScreenLayout` from `src/components/layout`.
- Spread backgrounds from `useScreenBackgrounds()` (`canvas`, `surface`, `brandWash`).
- Put backgrounds on `BackgroundLayer` via `ScreenLayout` props — not on `SafeAreaView`.

## Must not

- Invent a new `SafeAreaView` + `StatusBar` + `backgroundColor: canvas` cluster on a screen.
- Nest a second full-screen `SafeAreaView` with its own canvas fill inside `ScreenLayout` (tab bars may pad bottom only).

## Exceptions

- Modals / dialogs → `FormDialog` / `SheetDialog`
- Share-card capture views, launch overlay, native alarm challenge UI
